Proximi.io iOS map — Software Licence Agreement

═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
DRAFT — PENDING LEGAL REVIEW. NOT YET THE OPERATIVE LICENCE.

This text was drafted to be reviewed, not to be relied on. It has not been read
by a lawyer. Before it is published in place of the previous placeholder,
somebody with authority has to settle the decisions listed under "Open decisions"
at the end of this file, and then delete this banner and that section. Until
then, the licence that actually governs your use of the map is the separate
written agreement between you and Proximi.io — see clause 7.

This file is deliberately near-identical to the licence shipped with the
Proximi.io iOS SDK (github.com/proximiio/proximiio-sdk-ios-binary). The two
products are licensed on the same terms. Clauses 1, 6.3 and 8 differ, because
what the map is and what it brings with it differ; everywhere else the wording
is the same on purpose, and a change to one file should be made to both.
